@startuml
title Coverage reports: one snapshot, independent consumers
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam componentBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB
skinparam noteBorderColor #D97706

artifact "Downloaded baseline + plans\nActual files only when enabled" as inputs #F1F5F9
component "One immutable evaluation\nValid sets + file errors + gate outcome" as snapshot
artifact "JSON report\nCounts / hashes or first error" as json
artifact "Standalone HTML\nAssignments / counts / differences\nPartial evidence and diagnostics" as html
component "Gradle verification outcome\nFail for validation or report I/O errors" as gate
component "CI automation\nNormal tests AND coverage required" as ci #F1F5F9
actor "Reviewer\nDownload or CI artifact link" as reviewer

inputs --> snapshot : read each expected file once
snapshot --> json
snapshot --> html
snapshot --> gate
json --> ci : machine-readable evidence
gate --> ci : required outcome
html --> reviewer : consumer publishes artifact

note bottom of html
  No JavaScript or external assets.
  Unavailable evidence is not zero classes.
  Matching rows do not prove global success.
end note
note bottom of ci
  Selection coverage is not test execution.
  Publication cannot turn failure into success.
end note
@enduml
